note Fire bolt (tier I): X n3 p1 . Y n2 p0. Ratios 3 and 2 light the fifth and the root; the cloud locks a power chord (root + fifth) at C3.
note Fire up (low-passed, breathing with the orb), the bed steps back, a plucked C3 on lock. The voices are not listed: they keep following the chord tones.
